==Trivia==
*This card's {{TCGP|immersive card|immersive}} illustration includes {{p|Zorua}}, {{p|Pineco}}, {{p|Slowpoke}}, {{p|Dragonair}}, {{p|Ponyta}}, and {{p|Pikachu}}.
*This card's shiny immersive print is the first card of a {{Shiny}} Pokémon to have a [[rarity]] symbol other than {{Rar/TCGP|Shiny|1}} (excluding Promo cards).
*This is the first card to have multiple immersive prints in the same set.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Mew|32}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expanison.
*This card's 086/069 print features {{Shiny}} {{p|Mew}}, {{p|Zorua}}, {{p|Pineco}}, {{p|Slowpoke}}, {{p|Dragonair}}, {{p|Ponyta}}, and {{p|Pikachu}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

